A||||6||Banzai||Dirty wiring harness||||1||
Z||000000||Banzai||10-05-2001||06:20 PM||||Will be putting the guts back in my 84 next weekend. Any ideas on how to clean the wiring harness up. Will it be ok to clean it with simple green and water. or should I use wd-40. I'm going to put new split loom on it.<P>Banzai !!!!!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Rick 88||10-05-2001||08:30 PM||||I have had good results using "Fast Orange" hand cleaner. It cleans all the crud off both spark plug and harness wires and restores the original color. You should see my factory red Packard plug wires. It's a little messy but does the job.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Rick 88||||reg||3
Z||000002||Eric_PA||10-05-2001||11:00 PM||||Try the CASTRAL Superclean. I just used it on my wire harnesses, it works great. <P>Eric||||reg||14
Z||000003||theogre||10-05-2001||11:06 PM||||Simple Green, CitriSolv, 409, and many simlar products will remove crap from wiring w/o hurting it.<P>Avoid soaking water into the actual connectors. If water does get in them, blow them dry with compressed/canned "air" before assembling them.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Banzai||10-06-2001||12:46 AM||||Thanks all. I figured it was OK as long as they were well dried.  Project is coming along very nicely. I'll have pics in a couple weeks.  <P>Banzai !!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Tigger||10-06-2001||02:49 PM||||Best time to clean wiring is when it's out of the car.  Soak up a rag with water and & some simple green.  When done, carefully and quickly rinse the wiring off avoiding the connectors, wipe dry, and hang up to let the rest air dry.<P>Can't wait to see pictures!||||reg||1
Z||000006||voyagerspe||10-06-2001||11:19 PM||||ive always cleaned them in my parts washer(1/2 kerosene 1/2 miniral spirits) scrub them with a brush then hose it off with a garden hose.  I hang it to dry overnight. does a great job and never had any problems.<BR>||||reg||1
